      "created_at": "2012-01-02T22:04:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2012-01-02T22:04:22Z",
      "body": "In case I wasn't clear, I mean that the help string supports %-formatting variable expansion, such as \"%(default)s\". I think it would be good if a sentence were added to the end of the \"help\" section, saying something like:\r\n\r\nBecause the help string supports %-formatting, if you want a literal \"%\" to appear in the help string, you must escape it as \"%%\".",
